---
layout: page.njk
permalink: /notices/
title: Notices & merit lists
crumb: Notices
crumbs: []
description: "Admission notices, merit lists and exam schedules from RIPS Sheikhupura, newest first."
pageScript: filters
---
{#- Notices list (Doc 06 Notices checklist: title → filters → list → pagination → Archive link;
    IS-02: filter by program, type and session, kept in the address, count announced). Without
    JavaScript the full list shows. #}
<h1>Notices &amp; merit lists</h1>
{%- set notices = collections.notices | currentNotices(build.today) %}
{%- set programs = collections.programs | activePrograms %}
{%- if notices.length %}
<form class="notice-filters" action="/notices/" method="get" data-filters="notice" data-page-size="10">
  <fieldset class="filters">
    <legend>Filter notices</legend>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="f-program">Program</label>
      <select id="f-program" name="program">
        <option value="">All programs</option>
        {%- for p in programs %}
        <option value="{{ p.data.slug }}">{{ p.data.short }}</option>
        {%- endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="f-type">Type</label>
      <select id="f-type" name="type">
        <option value="">All types</option>
        {%- for t in ["Admission", "Merit list", "Exam", "General"] %}
        <option>{{ t }}</option>
        {%- endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="field">
      <label for="f-session">Session</label>
      <select id="f-session" name="session">
        <option value="">All sessions</option>
        {%- for s, items in notices | groupby("data.session") %}
        <option>{{ s }}</option>
        {%- endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>
    <div class="filter-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" type="submit" data-filter-submit>Show notices</button>
      <button class="btn btn-text" type="button" data-filter-clear>Clear filters</button>
    </div>
  </fieldset>
</form>
<p class="filter-count" role="status" data-filter-count>{{ notices.length }} notice{% if notices.length != 1 %}s{% endif %} shown</p>
<ul class="notice-list" data-filter-list>
  {%- for n in notices %}
  {%- set headingTag = "h2" %}
  {% include "partials/notice-row.njk" %}
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
<div class="empty-state" data-filter-empty hidden>
  <p>No notices match these filters.</p>
  <p><button class="btn btn-secondary" type="button" data-filter-clear>Clear filters</button></p>
  <p>Looking for something else? <a href="/contact/">Contact admissions</a>.</p>
</div>
<nav class="notice-pages" aria-label="Notice pages" data-pagination hidden></nav>
{%- else %}
<div class="empty-state">
  <p>Nothing posted yet.</p>
  <p><a href="/notices/archive/">See the archive</a></p>
</div>
{%- endif %}
<p><a href="/notices/archive/">Older notices: see the archive <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
